      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 18px; color: #0f172a;">100% Offline &amp; Private</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">
        No cloud servers, no account creation, and no data tracking. Your documents remain strictly inside your private Wi-Fi network.
      </p>
