    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 8px;">🔄</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 18px; color: #0f172a;">Auto-Start on Boot</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">
        The desktop server automatically runs silently in the Windows system tray when the PC starts. No manual launching required.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 8px;">⚙️</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 18px; color: #0f172a;">Complete Print Controls</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">
        Choose copies, color vs monochrome, paper size (A4, 4x6 Photo, Legal), orientation, duplex (double-sided), and fit-to-page scaling.
