    <ol style="font-size: 16px; color: #334155; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;">
      <li>
        <b>Step 1: Install PC Server</b> — Download and install <a href="https://github.com/kkrkishan/kkr-wireless-print/releases/download/v1.1.0/Print_Ofo_Setup.exe">Print_Ofo_Setup.exe</a> on your Windows 10 or Windows 11 PC. Launch the app to view your 6-digit security PIN and pairing QR code.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Step 2: Connect Phone</b> — Install the <a href="https://github.com/kkrkishan/kkr-wireless-print/releases/download/v1.1.0/Print_Ofo_Mobile_v1.1.0.apk">Print Ofo Mobile App</a> on your Android device. Ensure your phone and PC are on the same Wi-Fi (or connect phone to PC hotspot). Tap "Scan QR Code" or enter the 6-digit PIN once.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Step 3: Instant Printing</b> — Open any photo or PDF on your phone, click <b>Share &gt; Print Ofo</b>, choose your printer and settings, and tap <b>Print Now</b>!
      </li>
    </ol>
