  </h2>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 17px; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6px;">Q: Does Print Ofo need active internet connection?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #475569; margin: 0;">No. It works completely offline on your local Wi-Fi router or laptop Wi-Fi hotspot.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 17px; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6px;">Q: Do I need to enter the 6-digit PIN every time I print?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #475569; margin: 0;">No. Once paired, your phone saves an encrypted token. Printing is automatic thereafter.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 18px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 17px; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6px;">Q: Is my document data stored anywhere?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #475569; margin: 0;">Never. There are zero cloud servers. Data streams straight to the printer spooler via your local network.</p>
